00:31:03.770 --> 00:31:05.930
that Python function.

00:31:05.930 --> 00:31:08.870
This is just showing you the
very basic functionalities

00:31:08.870 --> 00:31:10.770
there.

00:31:10.770 --> 00:31:15.640
Let's see-- I think the hello
