00:31:20.060 --> 00:31:22.370
We spend most of our time
running very large machine

00:31:22.370 --> 00:31:24.890
learning workloads at scale.

00:31:24.890 --> 00:31:29.150
To give you an idea of
this, I had an idea--

00:31:29.150 --> 00:31:32.150
I guess it was probably
like a few days ago--

00:31:32.150 --> 00:31:35.090
where you see some
really cool stuff,

00:31:35.090 --> 00:31:39.740
like taking a Keras model that
